Find an integer $a$ such that

(a) $a \equiv 43 \pmod{23}$ and $-22 \le a \le 0$;
(b) $a \equiv 17 \pmod{29}$ and $-14 \le a \le 14$;
(c) $a \equiv -11 \pmod{21}$ and $90 \le a \le 110$.

